  "design": {
    "idea": "The Mold-Casting Gallery: under kiln_heat==surge, two overhead slag_pourers cast molten slag blocks into floor molds; rotate the central blue_transformer to quench both into pushable basalt blocks and slide them into the bridge counterweight sockets to cast the 9-tile lava bridge north.",
